<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="yue-Hant"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="似是故人來"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="梅豔芳"/><amll:meta key="album" value="2003 梅艷芳經典金曲演唱會"/><amll:meta key="composer" value="羅大佑"/><amll:meta key="lyricist" value="林夕"/><amll:meta key="year" value="2003"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="cmn-Hans"><text for="line-ce4dbea1-6dab-449a-9b95-782b16b6b342">大家似乎都喜欢我穿旗袍啊</text><text for="line-c50c9cc7-7f92-4733-be52-dba9c36402ab">啊 做歌星真是开心啊 真的</text><text for="line-3dc8a450-0a96-410b-a801-0d8056782b9d">尤其是 得到你们的爱呢</text><text for="line-089a2dde-b13c-4014-89e1-3c944ec027fe">真是开心啊</text><text for="line-80500447-c348-42c1-b08b-1668c287f8e9">现在我们已经不是歌手与歌迷之间</text><text for="line-1b6fad17-cc8d-4497-939a-ccb3c2ed0c60">现在我是全部当你们都是我的很好的老朋友</text><text for="line-237457b5-e899-43d3-be36-88a821bda37b">因为我想我们认识都起码有十几年了啊</text><text for="line-76b6a9d8-a094-40c8-853f-57e49ab0773b">如果不是怎能称得上是老朋友</text><text for="line-4464bfc7-f846-45a1-ba31-ed9fd178cb66">所以接下来这首歌的话呢</text><text for="line-dd498eca-1b56-4448-a3eb-77e75ddbf054">我会真的送给我的</text><text for="line-a2c8bbf3-cffc-4d51-ad61-588dd02a19b0">很好很好的歌迷 你们</text><text for="line-07a13fac-c377-4083-b62a-c8bd39deb5e7">adding 我的 old friends</text><text for="line-14ac550c-6717-4a69-8965-1b97cce141c7">歌名叫作似是故人来</text></translation><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="cmn-Hant"><text for="line-ce4dbea1-6dab-449a-9b95-782b16b6b342">大家似乎都喜歡我穿旗袍啊</text><text for="line-c50c9cc7-7f92-4733-be52-dba9c36402ab">啊 做歌星真是開心啊 真的</text><text for="line-3dc8a450-0a96-410b-a801-0d8056782b9d">尤其是 得到你們的愛呢</text><text for="line-089a2dde-b13c-4014-89e1-3c944ec027fe">真是開心啊</text><text for="line-80500447-c348-42c1-b08b-1668c287f8e9">現在我們已經不是歌手和歌迷之間</text><text for="line-1b6fad17-cc8d-4497-939a-ccb3c2ed0c60">現在我是全部當你們都是我的很好的老朋友</text><text for="line-237457b5-e899-43d3-be36-88a821bda37b">因爲我想我們認識都起碼有十幾年了啊</text><text for="line-76b6a9d8-a094-40c8-853f-57e49ab0773b">如果不是怎能稱得上是老朋友</text><text for="line-4464bfc7-f846-45a1-ba31-ed9fd178cb66">所以接下來這首歌的話呢</text><text for="line-dd498eca-1b56-4448-a3eb-77e75ddbf054">我會真的送給我的</text><text for="line-07a13fac-c377-4083-b62a-c8bd39deb5e7">adding 我的 old friends</text><text for="line-14ac550c-6717-4a69-8965-1b97cce141c7">歌名叫作似是故人來</text><text for="line-a2c8bbf3-cffc-4d51-ad61-588dd02a19b0">很好很好的歌迷 你們</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:26.397"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-ce4dbea1-6dab-449a-9b95-782b16b6b342" itunes:key="line-ce4dbea1-6dab-449a-9b95-782b16b6b342" begin="00:01.830" end="00:04.226"><span begin="00:01.830" end="00:01.970" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.830" end="00:01.970">daai6</span></span></span><span begin="00:01.970" end="00:02.050" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">家</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.970" end="00:02.050">gaa1</span></span></span><span begin="00:02.050" end="00:02.130" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">都</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:02.050" end="00:02.130">dou1</span></span></span><span begin="00:02.130" end="00:02.290" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">係</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:02.130" end="00:02.290">hai6</span></span></span><span begin="00:02.290" end="00:02.470" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">似</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:02.290" end="00:02.470">ci5</span></span></span><span begin="00:02.470" end="00:02.650" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乎</span><span tts:ruby="textCo